{"unit_id":"tag:03YD:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在《代数空间》第<REF_0001>节中，我们介绍了由开子空间（open subspaces）构成的代数空间（algebraic space）的 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）概念。下面给出将开子空间（open subspaces）换成开浸入（open immersions）后的相应概念。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"open subspaces","target_term":"开子空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"open subspaces","target_term":"开子空间"},{"source_term":"open immersions","target_term":"开浸入"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"open subspaces","target_term":"开子空间","context":"覆盖中的开子空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"所覆盖的空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"所定义的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"open immersions","target_term":"开浸入","context":"替换开子空间的态射；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:041G:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme），并设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic space）。所谓<TEXTITOPEN_0001>Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering），覆盖空间<MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，是态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0005>，由<MATH_0006>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）之间的态射组成，满足每个<MATH_0007>都是开浸入（open immersion），并且\n<MATH_0008>\n即这些态射（morphisms）联合为满射（surjective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"所覆盖的空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"本定义的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"构成覆盖的态射族；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"覆盖中的空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"覆盖态射的性质；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"构成覆盖的态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"联合满射性；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03YD:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n虽然 Zariski 覆盖（coverings）偶尔有用，但代数空间（algebraic spaces）的范畴（category）上的相应拓扑（topology）实在太粗，因而并不特别有用。不过，它确实定义了一个位点（site）。\n\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"Zariski 覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"拓扑所在范畴的对象；待批准。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"代数空间的范畴；待批准。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"覆盖给出的拓扑；待批准。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"相应位点；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:041H:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic space）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>若<MATH_0004>是同构（isomorphism），则<MATH_0005>是一个 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering），覆盖<MATH_0006>。\n<STRUCT_0003>若<MATH_0007>是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering），并且对每个<MATH_0008>都有一个 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）<MATH_0009>，则<MATH_0010>是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004>若<MATH_0011>是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering），且<MATH_0012>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），则<MATH_0013>是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被覆盖的对象；待批准。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"第一个覆盖公理；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"覆盖公理中的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射的源与目标；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"覆盖的拉回态射；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
